=== CLEAN IDENTITY CHECK:  tr(A^7) = 7*(c7 + TQ) ===
    TQ = #(directed-triangle, directed-4-cycle) pairs sharing >= 1 vertex (= tq1+tq2+tq3)
    exact on 120/120 tournaments (bad=0)
    => c7 = tr(A^7)/7 - TQ.  tr(A^7) is SPECTRAL; TQ is NOT (the overlap carrier).
    => THM-500's cospectral c7-split is exactly a TQ-split: c7 = tr(A^7)/7 - TQ,
       tr(A^7) fixed by the spectrum, so c7 varies iff the overlap count TQ varies.
    Mirrors codex HYP-2498: tr(A^6) = 6*c6 + 3*c3 + 6*p33_meet (intersecting tri pairs).

